{"id":"2687478","type":"page","ari":"ari:cloud:confluence:5e6ffe9a-235a-49ed-8a34-84aedba2db5c:page/2687478","base64EncodedAri":"YXJpOmNsb3VkOmNvbmZsdWVuY2U6NWU2ZmZlOWEtMjM1YS00OWVkLThhMzQtODRhZWRiYTJkYjVjOmNvbnRlbnQvMjY4NzQ3OA==","status":"current","title":"Market Data Request Limits","macroRenderedOutput":{},"body":{"view":{"value":"<div>Karma - Page Builder</div><div class=\"conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-name=\"toc-zone\" data-macro-id=\"bbc160a70cd04dbac2f75c3a6b3876f2889af3733dc2362d9f0144334446277f\" data-layout=\"full-width\" data-local-id=\"0fa82a3a-a03b-4c52-bd67-6caa347495f3\"><div class=\"toc-macro\"><a href=\"#MarketDataRequestLimits-WhatareMarketDataRequestLimits?\">What are Market Data Request Limits?</a> | <a href=\"#MarketDataRequestLimits-listMarketCatalogue\">listMarketCatalogue</a> | <a href=\"#MarketDataRequestLimits-listMarketBook/listRunnerBook\">listMarketBook/listRunnerBook</a> | <a href=\"#MarketDataRequestLimits-listMarketProfitandLoss\">listMarketProfitandLoss</a></div><h2 id=\"MarketDataRequestLimits-WhatareMarketDataRequestLimits?\">What are Market Data Request Limits?</h2><p>Although you can request multiple markets from <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/1smk3cen4v3lu3yomq5qye0ni/pages/2687510/listMarketBook\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2687510\" data-linked-resource-version=\"43\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">listMarketBook</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/1smk3cen4v3lu3yomq5qye0ni/pages/2687847/listRunnerBook\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2687847\" data-linked-resource-version=\"15\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">listRunnerBook</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"/wiki/spaces/1smk3cen4v3lu3yomq5qye0ni/pages/2687517/listMarketCatalogue\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2687517\" data-linked-resource-version=\"18\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">listMarketCatalogue</a>&nbsp;and <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/1smk3cen4v3lu3yomq5qye0ni/pages/2687667/listMarketProfitAndLoss\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2687667\" data-linked-resource-version=\"17\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">listMarketProfitandLoss</a>, there are limits on the amount of data requested in <strong>one request.</strong></p><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"5a408b5c-daf5-42a4-9381-f70c21cc0342\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"background-color: #B3D4FF;border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\" style=\"background-color: #B3D4FF;\">\n<p><strong>sum(Weight)</strong> *<strong> number market ids</strong> must not exceed 200 points per requests</p>\n</div></div><p>The following tables explain the &quot;weighting&quot; of data for each&nbsp;<strong>MarketProjection</strong>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<strong>PriceProjection</strong>. If you exceed the maximum weighting of 200 points, the API will return a&nbsp;<strong>TOO_MUCH_DATA</strong>&nbsp;error.</p><h2 id=\"MarketDataRequestLimits-listMarketCatalogue\">listMarketCatalogue</h2><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"3494ba01-4e71-4e9e-b4d4-f22ca967825d\" class=\"confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 761.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 760.0px;\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>MarketProjection</strong></p></th><th class=\"confluenceTh\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Weight</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">MARKET_DESCRIPTION</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">1</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">RUNNER_DESCRIPTION</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">0</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">EVENT</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">0</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">EVENT_TYPE</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">0</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">COMPETITION</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">0</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">RUNNER_METADATA</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">1</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">MARKET_START_TIME</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">0</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 id=\"MarketDataRequestLimits-listMarketBook/listRunnerBook\">listMarketBook/listRunnerBook</h2><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"619a5e83-3563-493b-86d2-3e8ea357bc21\" class=\"confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 761.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 760.0px;\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-blue1\">PriceProjection</span></strong></p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-blue1\">Weight</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Null (No PriceProjection set)</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">2</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">SP_AVAILABLE</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">3</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">SP_TRADED</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">7</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">EX_BEST_OFFERS</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">5</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">EX_ALL_OFFERS</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">17</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">EX_TRADED</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">17</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong>Please note</strong>: specific combinations of priceProjections will carry different weights that aren't the sum of their individual weights. &nbsp;Please see a summary of these below:</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"f127305c-4038-44f0-9636-67c44a63fab1\" class=\"confluenceTable\"><tbody><tr><td data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-blue1\">PriceProjection</span></strong></p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-blue1\">Weight</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">EX_BEST_OFFERS + EX_TRADED</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">20</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">EX_ALL_OFFERS + EX_TRADED</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">32</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p/><p>If&nbsp;<strong>exBestOffersOverrides</strong> is used the weight is&nbsp;is calculated by <strong>weight * (requestedDepth/3)</strong>.</p><h2 id=\"MarketDataRequestLimits-listMarketProfitandLoss\">listMarketProfitandLoss</h2><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"b959cdfc-86a9-46cf-83fe-484208e41e35\" class=\"confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 762.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 759.0px;\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>PriceProjection</strong></p></td><td data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Weight</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Not applicable</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">4</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p/><p/><div class=\"toc-macro\"><a href=\"#MarketDataRequestLimits-WhatareMarketDataRequestLimits?\">What are Market Data Request Limits?</a> | <a href=\"#MarketDataRequestLimits-listMarketCatalogue\">listMarketCatalogue</a> | <a href=\"#MarketDataRequestLimits-listMarketBook/listRunnerBook\">listMarketBook/listRunnerBook</a> | <a href=\"#MarketDataRequestLimits-listMarketProfitandLoss\">listMarketProfitandLoss</a></div></div><p><br/></p>","representation":"view","_expandable":{"webresource":"","embeddedContent":"","mediaToken":"","content":"/rest/api/content/2687478"}},"_expandable":{"editor":"","atlas_doc_format":"","export_view":"","styled_view":"","markdown":"","dynamic":"","storage":"","editor2":"","anonymous_export_view":""}},"extensions":{"position":769016362},"_expandable":{"container":"/rest/api/space/1smk3cen4v3lu3yomq5qye0ni","metadata":"","restrictions":"/rest/api/content/2687478/restriction/byOperation","history":"/rest/api/content/2687478/history","version":"","descendants":"/rest/api/content/2687478/descendant","space":"/rest/api/space/1smk3cen4v3lu3yomq5qye0ni","childTypes":"","schedulePublishInfo":"","operations":"","schedulePublishDate":"","children":"/rest/api/content/2687478/child","ancestors":"","draftVersion":""},"_links":{"editui":"/pages/resumedraft.action?draftId=2687478","webui":"/spaces/1smk3cen4v3lu3yomq5qye0ni/pages/2687478/Market+Data+Request+Limits","edituiv2":"/spaces/1smk3cen4v3lu3yomq5qye0ni/pages/edit-v2/2687478","context":"/wiki","self":"https://betfair-developer-docs.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/content/2687478","tinyui":"/x/9gEp","collection":"/rest/api/content","base":"https://betfair-developer-docs.atlassian.net/wiki"}}